# sepolicy.rule
#
# Custom SELinux policy rules for microG Minimal.
#
# Android 9 Go (API 28) executes priv-app system applications under standard
# SELinux domains (system_file / privapp_data_file). Because microG GmsCoreGo
# and Phonesky are mounted directly into system/priv-app with standard 0644
# permissions and inherit standard priv-app SELinux contexts, no custom
# type transitions, capability grants, or permissive rules are required.
#
# This file is intentionally left without active rules to avoid broadening
# SELinux permissions unnecessarily.
